editor product interface Claude Code
provider model provider Anthropic
product product name Claude Code
role repository role Bakery, core infrastructure lane
modality text-or-voice text
model unverified
model_status active runtime unverified
configured_model claude-haiku-5-5 -- the model this lap was launched under; not runtime telemetry
